# Azure OpenAI (REQUIRED for AI tag generation)
# EU-hosted, GDPR-compliant replacement for api.openai.com.
# Azure Portal: create an "Azure OpenAI" resource in an EU region (we use West
# Europe), then deploy a gpt-4o-mini model under Azure AI Foundry > Deployments
# with deployment type DataZoneStandard, so inference stays inside the EU data
# zone. GlobalStandard would route inference worldwide, including the US.
# The deployment name — not the model name — is what we configure below.
HOPPS_AZURE_OPENAI_RESOURCE_NAME=your-azure-openai-resource-name
HOPPS_AZURE_OPENAI_DEPLOYMENT_NAME=gpt-4o-mini
HOPPS_AZURE_OPENAI_KEY=your-azure-openai-key-here
